    <Requirement id="ER-P082-02" level="1" requirementType="maintainability">
      <sysml:Name>中央冷却器可拆卸端盖</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>中央冷却器冷却水侧应设有可拆卸的端盖，以便于内部检查和清洗。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="inspection" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P082" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-COOLER-MAINT-003" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-COOLER-MAINT-004" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-MAINT-002" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>无法拆卸端盖将导致冷却器内部无法清洗和检查，影响换热效率和设备寿命。</RiskIfUnmet>
        <ApplicabilityConstraint>E-COOLER-MAINT-003和E-COOLER-MAINT-004基于MAN特定机型，适用范围限于对应厂家和机型；E-SUPP-MAINT-002为通用实践。</ApplicabilityConstraint>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查冷却器图纸，确认冷却水侧设有可拆卸端盖。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>现场检查端盖拆卸空间，应满足工具操作和人员检修要求，具体空间尺寸按厂家安装手册确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【中央冷却器可拆卸端盖】，来自原始需求「冷却水侧应设有可拆卸的端盖以便于内部检查和清洗」。E-COOLER-MAINT-003、E-COOLER-MAINT-004、E-SUPP-MAINT-002间接支撑了冷却器维护可达性要求，但未明确提及端盖可拆卸。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
